WEBVTT

00:03:59.660 --> 00:04:02.488
but he never forgot that profound
experience of loneliness

00:04:02.512 --> 00:04:04.206
in his own work life.

00:04:04.230 --> 00:04:08.011
He began to observe that loneliness was
often at the root of many health issues,

00:04:08.035 --> 00:04:09.186
and it alarmed him.

00:04:09.210 --> 00:04:11.308
VM: And nobody came up to me and said,

00:04:11.332 --> 00:04:13.746
"Hi, my name is John. I'm lonely."

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:16.316
But I found that once I surfaced it

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:17.724
even just a little bit

00:04:17.748 --> 00:04:19.688
and asked this basic question:

00:04:19.712 --> 00:04:21.916
"Is loneliness a problem in your life,

00:04:21.940 --> 00:04:23.951
a problem for the people around you?"

00:04:23.975 --> 00:04:25.845
Then it was like the floodgates opened,

00:04:25.845 --> 00:04:28.106
and everyone had a story to share.

00:04:28.130 --> 00:04:30.961
AG: As surgeon general,
Vivek started looking into the data